      "content": "\"letting go\"... that's exactly it. but it feels like there's no way to actually do that while you're still here, just dragging this heavy thing around. if the story is really done, like you said, and the character is gone... then why am i still being forced to watch the static? it just feels so heavy, like there's no point in even continuing to exist when the actual life part of it is over.",
